<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
<!ENTITY name "msf">
<!ENTITY author "luochuhan">
<!ENTITY version "0.4.7.1">
<!ENTITY githubRepo "scoltzero/msf">
<!ENTITY releaseTag "v0.4.7.1">
<!ENTITY packageName "msf-0.4.7.1-x86_64-1">
<!ENTITY packageFile "&packageName;.txz">
<!ENTITY packageURL "https://github.com/&githubRepo;/releases/download/&releaseTag;/&packageFile;">
<!ENTITY packageSHA256 "233b95a34024bf2de0b7347979318fc2091576edab327914ab7b8a672e792665">
]>
<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" pluginURL="https://github.com/&githubRepo;/releases/latest/download/msf.plg" launch="Utilities/&name;" support="https://github.com/&githubRepo;/issues" icon="network-wired" min="6.12.0">
  <CHANGES>
    <![CDATA[
### msf 0.4.7.1

#### 用户体验修复小版本

- 修复 MosDNS DDNS、直连、拦截、代理、直连 IP 与重定向 IP 等规则列表的格式兼容与运行时热同步；订阅更新后会校验实际运行态，并刷新前置 DNS 缓存，避免文件已更新但规则未生效。
- 统一导入域名规则的 `full`、`domain`、`keyword` 与 `regexp` 格式处理，修复对象或非标准条目进入规则文件后无法匹配的问题。
- 在 DNS 查询日志中增加独立的“查询结果”列，显示实际应答值并去除重复的记录类型与 TTL；保留原表格列宽关系，并修复对象应答显示为 `[object Object]`。
- 新增明确的“清空 DNS 缓存”操作，逐项清理全部七个 MosDNS 运行时缓存并报告具体失败项；原有操作更名为“清空生成规则”，避免误认为会清除 DNS 缓存。
- 清空 DNS 缓存不会删除规则、订阅、配置、自动生成规则或 Mihomo Fake-IP 数据库；相关操作增加独立确认提示和重复点击保护。

    ]]>
  </CHANGES>

  <FILE Name="/boot/config/plugins/&name;/&packageFile;" Run="upgradepkg --install-new --reinstall">
    <URL>&packageURL;</URL>
    <SHA256>&packageSHA256;</SHA256>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash">
    <INLINE>
      <![CDATA[
set -e
mkdir -p /boot/config/plugins/msf
cfg="/boot/config/plugins/msf/msf.cfg"
if [ ! -f "$cfg" ]; then
  cat > "$cfg" <<'CFGEOF'
ENABLED="yes"
HOST="0.0.0.0"
PORT="7777"
DATA_DIR="/mnt/user/appdata/msf"
CFGEOF
fi
chmod 0755 /etc/rc.d/rc.msf 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 0755 /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/msf/event/started 2>/dev/null || true
chmod 0755 /usr/local/emhttp/plugins/msf/event/stopping_svcs 2>/dev/null || true
if grep -q '^ENABLED="yes"' "$cfg" && [ -x /etc/rc.d/rc.msf ]; then
  nohup /etc/rc.d/rc.msf start >/dev/null 2>&1 &
fi
      ]]>
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>

  <FILE Run="/bin/bash" Method="remove">
    <INLINE>
      <![CDATA[
set +e
if [ -x /etc/rc.d/rc.msf ]; then
  /etc/rc.d/rc.msf stop
fi
removepkg msf-0.4.7.1-x86_64-1
rm -f /boot/config/plugins/msf/msf-0.4.7.1-x86_64-1.txz
echo "msf plugin removed. Persistent data remains under /mnt/user/appdata/msf unless you delete it manually."
      ]]>
    </INLINE>
  </FILE>
</PLUGIN>
